            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.71

- Swipe up and down on the album art to change the volume, in both the desktop overlay and full screen. It moves in the same steps the volume keys use, and each step gives a small click, so you can feel how far you have moved without looking. As with changing track, it only works while the pointer is over the artwork.
- A gesture now commits to one direction at the start, so a slightly diagonal swipe changes either the track or the volume, never a bit of both.
]]></description>
